<p>Partially dissipates all incoming damage, reducing it by 30%, up to a maximum of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">28, 38, 46, 52, 58.</acronym></p><p>The maximum damage reduction will scale with your Spellpower.</p>